#. ボクの部屋と舞園さんの部屋は、
#. <CLT 3>ネームプレートが交換<CLT>されてたんだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The nameplates on my and Sayaka's rooms <CLT 3>got\n"
"switched<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. ネームプレートが…？
msgctxt "0002 | CELES"
msgid "They got...switched?"
msgstr ""

#. そう、部屋の交換と同じようにね…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's right. The nameplates got switched, just like\n"
"the rooms themselves."
msgstr ""

#. そのせいで、苗木君がいた舞園さんの部屋は、
#. “苗木誠”のネームプレートになり…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"As a result, the nameplate on Sayaka's room actually\n"
"had Makoto's name."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんがいた苗木君の部屋は、
#. “舞園さやか”のネームプレートになっていたのよ。
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "And the nameplate on Makoto's room had Sayaka's."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、<CLT 3>“舞園さやか”<CLT>のネームプレートの部屋には、
#. 本当に舞園がいたという事か…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So what you're saying is, the room <CLT 3>Sayaka<CLT> was\n"
"staying in, was actually marked as her room."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そのメモの通りに行動しても、
#. 舞園さんがいる苗木君の部屋には行けたんだね…
msgctxt "0007 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"Then...if someone *did* do what the note said, they\n"
"would end up at Makoto's room, where Sayaka was..."
msgstr ""

#. しかも、２人の部屋は隣同士…
#. ネームプレートを入れ替えるにはうってつけだった…
msgctxt "0008 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Plus, their rooms are right next to each other. So\n"
"switching the nameplates would be no problem."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、それをやったのは誰なのかしらね…
#. もちろん、苗木君じゃないのよね？
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And the one who switched the names was...\n"
"Well of course it wasn't you, right Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん……
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "R-Right..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんじゃ…誰がやったっつーんだよ…
msgctxt "0011 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Okay...then who did it?"
msgstr ""

#. 殺人犯
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The killer"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人だよ…
#. ネームプレートを交換したのは犯人なんだ！
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The killer had to be the one to switch the nameplates!"
msgstr ""

#. あのさ、自信満々のところ悪いんだけど…
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, uh...sorry to burst your bubble, but..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は、現場が“苗木の部屋”だって、
#. 知らなかったはずだよね？
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"They had no idea that they were actually in your room,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば…そうだね…
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Actually, yeah...you're right."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木誠
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Me"
msgstr ""

#. もしかしてボクが…
#. ネームプレートを交換したのかも…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Maybe I was the one who switched them."
msgstr ""

#. いや、でも覚えがないし…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um, but...I don't remember ever doing that."
msgstr ""

#. どっちだっつーの…
msgctxt "0021 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Okay, so which is it?"
msgstr ""

#. はっきりしない奴だ…
#. 発言するなら責任を持て。
msgctxt "0022 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You seem eternally confused. Try thinking before you\n"
"speak."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さやか
msgctxt "0024 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sayaka"
msgstr ""

#. 今は発言しなければ、議論は進まないわ。
msgctxt "0025 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If you don't do something, the trial can't move\n"
"forward."
msgstr ""

#. 時間には限りがある…
#. 最悪の結果をあなたは望んでいるの？
msgctxt "0026 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We don't have all the time in the world. You're not\n"
"*trying* to lose this case, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ネームプレートの交換が可能だった人物…
#. それは、あの人しかいない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one person who could have switched the\n"
"nameplates.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ネームプレートの交換が可能だった人物…
#. それは、あの人しかいない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one person who could have switched the\n"
"nameplates.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボク以外に部屋の交換の事を知っていた、
#. あの人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The only other person who knew we had switched\n"
"rooms...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そもそも、部屋の交換を知ってたのは、
#. <CLT 3>ボクと舞園さんだけ<CLT>なんだ…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Me and Sayaka<CLT> were the only ones who ever knew about\n"
"us switching rooms."
msgstr ""

#. だから、ネームプレートの交換が出来たのは…
#. ボク以外には、舞園さんしかいないはずだよ。
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So the only other person besides me who would even\n"
"know to switch the nameplates...was Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. その事は、彼女が残したメモの文面からも
#. 推測出来るわね…
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You can also infer as much from her note..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>２人きりで話したい事があります。
#. ５分後に私の部屋に来てください。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"There's something I want to talk to you about, just\n"
"us two. In five minutes, come see me in my room.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>部屋を間違えないように、
#. ちゃんと部屋のネームプレートを確認してくださいね。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>\"Check the nameplates to make sure you don't get the\n"
"wrong room, okay?\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 彼女は、呼び出した人物に対して、
#. 部屋のネームプレートを確認しろと言っている…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She specifically tells the reader to check the\n"
"nameplate."
msgstr ""

#. ネームプレートの入れ替えを知っていなければ、
#. 書けない言葉よ…
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She would only have written that if she knew the\n"
"nameplates had been switched."
msgstr ""

#. でも、どうして舞園さんは、
#. ネームプレートの交換なんかをしたの…？
msgctxt "0038 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "But...why would she switch them in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#. “苗木君との部屋の交換”を隠した上で、
#. 自分のいる部屋に、人を呼びたかったからよ…
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She wanted someone to come to the room she was in, and\n"
"*also* hide the fact that it was Makoto's room."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. 部屋の交換を隠した上で人を呼ぶって…
#. そんな事して、なんの意味があんの！？
msgctxt "0041 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Inviting someone to \"your\" room, but not telling them\n"
"you'd switched rooms... Why would anyone do that?"
msgstr ""

#. それについて知る為には…
msgctxt "0042 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "To understand that..."
msgstr ""

#. 彼女が、その人物を部屋に招き入れた後…
#. そこで何が起きたのかを知る必要があるわ。
msgctxt "0043 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"...we first need to understand what happened after she\n"
"invited the person into the room."
msgstr ""

#. 答えは、そこにあるはずだから…
msgctxt "0044 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's where the answer lies..."
msgstr ""

#. その後に起きた事か…おそらく…
msgctxt "0045 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "What happened then was...probably..."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園くんに呼び出された人物が…
#. そこで…彼女に襲い掛かり……
msgctxt "0046 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"Whoever she invited over...\n"
"came in, and...attacked her!"
msgstr ""

#. なんとっ、犯人が判明してしまったぞ！！
#. 呼び出された人物が犯人なのだ！
msgctxt "0047 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"We figured it out! We know who did it! Whoever she\n"
"invited over is the culprit!"
msgstr ""

#. そいつが誰かが問題なんだろーが…
msgctxt "0048 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "But we still don't know who it is, ya goddamn idiot..."
msgstr ""

#. あの部屋では、最初に、
#. 舞園さんと犯人の争いがあったのですよね？
msgctxt "0049 | CELES"
msgid "Sayaka fought with her killer there in the room, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. もしや、そこでの争いの中に、
#. 先程の問いの答えがあるのではないですか？
msgctxt "0050 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the answer to our previous question lies in\n"
"that initial struggle."
msgstr ""

#. えぇ…その通りよ…
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Yes, I think you're right."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そこで、どんな争いがあったのかを
#. ハッキリさせればいいんだね！？
msgctxt "0052 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Then...we just have to figure out what happened during\n"
"the fight, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. そう言えば、あの現場には模擬刀が落ちていたな。
#. あれは、そこでの争いに使われた物ではないのか？
msgctxt "0053 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That reminds me... There was a replica sword at the\n"
"murder scene. Was that perhaps used during the fight?"
msgstr ""

#. そういや…あれってなんなんだ？
msgctxt "0054 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Oh yeah, what's the deal with that sword?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんに勧められて…
#. ボクが護身用に持って帰った物なんだけど…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sayaka suggested I should hold on to it. I thought it\n"
"might come in handy if I had to defend myself..."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、犯人はあの模擬刀で、
#. 舞園さんの右手首を骨折させたんだよ…
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It seems pretty likely that the killer used it to\n"
"break Sayaka's right wrist."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園の骨折が模擬刀のせいって…
#. なんで、そんな事がわかんの？
msgctxt "0057 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"How the hell could you possibly know that's what broke\n"
"her wrist!?"
msgstr ""

#. わりー、さっぱり意味分かんねーわ！
#. 模擬刀と舞園の骨折が、どうつながんだ？
msgctxt "0058 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, this just doesn't make any sense! How is\n"
"there any connection between the sword and her wrist?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あんだよ、実は適当言ったんで
#. いまさら困ってんのか？
msgctxt "0060 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"What? You just threw that out there, and *now* you\n"
"don't know what to say?"
msgstr ""

#. 舞園の骨折が模擬刀のせいって
#. なんでわかったのか、早く説明しろよなァ！
msgctxt "0061 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Hurry up and tell us how you know it was the sword\n"
"that broke Sayaka's sword!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの骨折が、
#. 模擬刀のせいだとわかる根拠は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason I know Sayaka's wrist was broken with the\n"
"fake sword is because...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの骨折が、
#. 模擬刀のせいだとわかる根拠…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The reason I know Sayaka's wrist was broken with the\n"
"fake sword is because...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼女の骨折した箇所…
#. それ以外には考えられない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When you look at her wrist, there's no doubt...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それは、<CLT 3>骨折した舞園さんの右手首<CLT>を見れば、
#. わかるはずだよ。
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"All you have to do is take a good look at her <CLT 3>broken\n"
"wrist<CLT>, and it should become pretty clear."
msgstr ""

#. 右手首の腫れている部分に、
#. 何かキラキラした物が付いてたでしょ？
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Right there where her wrist is all swollen, there's\n"
"something glittery there, see?"
msgstr ""

#. もしかして…<CLT 3>金箔<CLT>…？
msgctxt "0068 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Is...is that <CLT 3>gold<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、あの模擬刀の金箔だよ。
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It sure is. Specifically, the gold coating from the\n"
"replica sword."
msgstr ""

#. あの金箔って、少し触っただけでも、
#. すぐ手に付いちゃうんだけど…
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You barely have to touch that stuff and it'll stick\n"
"right to you."
msgstr ""

#. それが、舞園さんの手首に付いてたって事はさ…
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And there's some on her wrist because..."
msgstr ""

#. そうか！　そこに模擬刀の打撃を受けたからだな！
msgctxt "0072 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I got it! Because she got hit with the sword, right\n"
"there on her wrist!"
msgstr ""

#. なるほど、なるほど…
#. 真相に近付いてきた気がしますな…
msgctxt "0073 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "I see, I see... And so the truth draws ever closer..."
msgstr ""

#. よっしゃ、じゃあ一気に謎を解くべ！
#. あの部屋で起きた事の一部始終を解明してやるって！
msgctxt "0074 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Alright! Then it's about time to solve this mystery!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの部屋で起きた事…か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What happened in my room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死の真相を突き止める為にも、
#. まずは、それを明らかにしないとな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And what led to Sayaka's death... That's what we need\n"
"to make clear.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
